{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SINGLE-PLAYER TURN-BASED STRATEGY DECKBUILDING ROGUELIKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Federation has been at peace for centuries and strategists of all species now only prove their worth by playing a peculiar board game... The prestigious Road to Fame is a series of 7 battles that only the most tactical minds can overcome. Will you prove your mastery of the stones and reach the end of the Road?</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your <strong>character</strong> and <strong>starting deck</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against various opponents by <strong>placing stones on a board</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage the <strong>combo rules</strong> and <strong>special effects</strong> of your stones to  trigger strong moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins and buy new stones to <strong>expand your deck</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge your stones</strong> to combine their effects and create move powerful moves</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103780/extras/fccedc4f39956550f94bde93ddd66237.poster.avif?t=1760978239\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103780/extras/fccedc4f39956550f94bde93ddd66237.webm?t=1760978239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103780/extras/fccedc4f39956550f94bde93ddd66237.mp4?t=1760978239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Stones aims at providing a <strong>minimalist yet deep</strong> strategy deckbuilding experience. The mechanics are simple but they offer a compelling variety of tactical decisions. Which stone to play? Where to place it on the board? Which stones to merge together to find synergies and maximize their scoring potential? How to counteract the opponent incoming moves? <strong>Strategy</strong> and <strong>versatility</strong> will be your most needed skills to face the challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103780/extras/5680686abb4b33ad7e6f3066891ceec3.avif?t=1760978239\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT RADIANT SLOTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radiant Sloth (he/him) is a <strong>solo indie game developer</strong> from France, He has a passion for creating <strong>inspiring and entertaining art</strong>, and is committed to <strong>ethical and sustainable game development</strong>. In particular, he strives to maintain <strong>honest and transparent communication</strong> with the community, advocates <strong>awareness of carbon footprint</strong> and climate issues, and <strong>bans generative AI tools</strong> from his creation process.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103780?t=1760978239","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103780?t=1760978239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103780/01f48619aa499ff3549ed71614c8985f7a3842d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760978239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103780/01f48619aa499ff3549ed71614c8985f7a3842d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760978239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playab